									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >We March as One is an incremental-style auto battler about building a massive army of shapes.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Paint Your Army</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.poster.avif?t=1792425821" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.webm?t=1792425821" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/198a9263049b3618e606dc9451f2a90b.mp4?t=1792425821" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Paint your troops directly onto the battlefield however you like</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Tactically position them to counter the enemy force</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Upgrade Your Units</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.poster.avif?t=1792425821" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.webm?t=1792425821" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/37dc33043c8032ac58616764e2319372.mp4?t=1792425821" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Earn gold from defeated enemies, whether you win or lose the battle</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" > Recruit more troops, unlock new unit types from a branching skill tree, and return with a stronger army</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" > Fallen troops return for the next battle, so you keep the army you’ve built</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Massive Battles</strong><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.poster.avif?t=1792425821" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.webm?t=1792425821" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5189160/extras/301ae21b7ad2282607bef4d7fdbe332b.mp4?t=1792425821" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every soldier and projectile individually simulated</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" > Isometric, top-down, or fly-through modes give you multiple ways to view the action</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Level editor</p></li></ul><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Experiment with unusual army compositions across different battlefield layouts</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse sys_req" style="max-height: 300px;">
		<h2>System Requirements</h2>
				<div class="sysreq_contents">
							<div class="game_area_sys_req sysreq_content active" data-os="win">
											<div class="game_area_sys_req_full">
							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (21H1 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core CPU — Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any DirectX 11 capable GPU with 1 GB VRAM (GeForce GTX 750 / Radeon R7 260 / Intel UHD 630)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2048 MB available space</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
															<div style="clear: both;"></div>

									</div>
					</div>
	</div>
	<script type="text/javascript">
		$J( function() {
			var $Tabs = $J('.sysreq_tab');
			var $Content = $J('.sysreq_content');

			$Tabs.click( function() {
				var $Tab = $J(this);
				$Tabs.removeClass('active');
				$Tab.addClass('active');

				$Content.removeClass('active');
				$Content.filter('[data-os=' + $Tab.data('os') + ']').addClass('active');

				$Content.trigger('gamepage_autocollapse_expand');
			});
		} );
	</script>

				
								
